OL,3,ANvidia hires major US law firm to
OL,4,Ainvestigate alleged Chinese spy affair
OL,5,
OL,6,FNvidia has hired one of the largest law
OL,7,Ffirms in the US to investigate the
OL,8,Faffair between its own chief executive
OL,9,Fand an alleged Chinese spy.
OL,11,FJensen Huang, who co-founded the tech
OL,12,Fcompany, has admitted to having a
OL,13,Fromantic relationship outside of his
OL,14,Fmarriage. The woman, Alice Huang, is
OL,15,Falleged to be a spy for Beijing.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
