OL,3,AWhy Walliams' unprecedented legal
OL,4,Abattle to stay anonymous failed
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Walliams' unprecedented legal
OL,7,Fbattle not to be named in relation to
OL,8,Fallegations against him went downhill
OL,9,Fas he tried to secure a permanent
OL,10,Finjunction.
OL,12,FHe was named by the Guardian and ITN
OL,13,Fbecause he had no sound legal reason to
OL,14,Fprevent the news organisations'
OL,15,Finvestigation from being published. In
OL,16,Fresponse to the allegations included,
OL,17,FWalliams said he was "not a sexual
OL,18,Fpredator" and had not "broken the law".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
