CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1794392357
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWhy Walliams' unprecedented legal
OL,4,Abattle to stay anonymous failed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 55-year-old's bid for an injunction
OL,7,Fhad been an open secret from the start
OL,8,Fafter what would have normally been an
OL,9,Fanonymised application briefly appeared
OL,10,Funder his own name on a court cases
OL,11,Fregister.
OL,13,FHis exceptionally unusual attempt to
OL,14,Fgag the media - forever - became clear
OL,15,Fat the full trial last month - but
OL,16,Fthat's when his bid to remain anonymous
OL,17,Fgot worse.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
