OL,3,APolice told Russell Brand to leave
OL,4,AJemima Goldsmith's house in 2014
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have confirmed they asked
OL,7,FRussell Brand to leave his
OL,8,Fex-girlfriend Jemima Goldsmith's house
OL,9,Fin 2014 after she reported an alleged
OL,10,Fassault.
OL,12,FThames Valley Police said officers were
OL,13,Fcontacted by the alleged victim on 25
OL,14,FJuly 2014 but no arrests were made.
OL,16,FBrand was asked to leave the
OL,17,FOxfordshire address "as per the
OL,18,Fvictim's wishes", the police added in a
OL,19,Fstatement on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
